# NAME: DNS (Foreign only)
# 用途: 将国外公共 DNS / DoH / DoT 走 🧭 DNS 策略组
# 说明: 不含国内 DNS（阿里/腾讯/114 等），IP 规则带 no-resolve 避免二次解析

# ========== Cloudflare ==========
IP-CIDR,1.1.1.1/32,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,1.0.0.1/32,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,1.1.1.2/31,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,1.0.0.2/31,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,1.1.1.3/32,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,1.0.0.3/32,no-resolve
DOMAIN,one.one.one.one
DOMAIN,1dot1dot1dot1.cloudflare-dns.com
DOMAIN,cloudflare-dns.com
DOMAIN,chrome.cloudflare-dns.com
DOMAIN,mozilla.cloudflare-dns.com
DOMAIN,opera.cloudflare-dns.com
DOMAIN,family.cloudflare-dns.com
DOMAIN,security.cloudflare-dns.com
DOMAIN,dns.cloudflare.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cloudflare-dns.com

